(7601450, 1227708, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, thought it would do well.,now is that a real frog :) </i></td></tr></table>I don''t think it is. I gave it a 7 for being hilarious. If it''s a real frog, I gave it a 7 for being miraculous. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> So were still waiting for an answer :)</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by Neat: Congrats, thought it would do well.,now is that a real frog :) I don''t think it is. I gave it a 7 for being hilarious. If it''s a real frog, I gave it a 7 for being miraculous.    So were still waiting for an answer :)', '2018-11-07 21:59:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7601454, 1227708, 60581, '<td valign="top">LOL yes I am going to give answer :D there is nothing to hide.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats, thought it would do well.,now is that a real frog :) </i></td></tr></table>I don''t think it is. I gave it a 7 for being hilarious. If it''s a real frog, I gave it a 7 for being miraculous. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/> So were still waiting for an answer :) </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'LOL yes I am going to give answer :D there is nothing to hide. Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by Neat: Congrats, thought it would do well.,now is that a real frog :) I don''t think it is. I gave it a 7 for being hilarious. If it''s a real frog, I gave it a 7 for being miraculous.    So were still waiting for an answer :) ', '2018-11-07 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 0),
